OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThere will
OL,6,Fbe a mixture of clear spells and a few
OL,7,Fshowers through the evening. Overnight
OL,8,Fsome more frequent showers push south
OL,9,Finto northern counties. A windy night.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FRather cloudy with rain or
OL,12,Fshowers in the morning, some heavy.
OL,13,FBright spells in the afternoon as
OL,14,Fshowers become more scattered. Fresh
OL,15,Fto strong westerly winds. On the cool
OL,16,Fside.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
